{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/f1777c107e1d8a8d034d0d1f00ca6285.avif?t=1772460887\" width=640 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Blood</strong> is a brutal <strong>1\u20134 player co-op roguelike</strong> set in a twisted <strong>bloodpunk samurai world</strong>, where ruthless apes wield katanas in a revenge-fueled rampage against the mafia that desecrated their sacred Shrine of Vermillion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shrine now calls for retribution \u2014 and it\u2019s paid in blood, delivered through unrelenting <strong>katana combat</strong> and sheer brutality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/f2b1fe4625d4d92a01c452945fef4271.webp?t=1772460887\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.poster.avif?t=1772460887\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.webm?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.mp4?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix both <strong>online</strong> and <strong>local co-op</strong> seamlessly \u2014 couch warriors and distant friends can join the same blood-soaked run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or <strong>go solo</strong> and carve your path through vengeance alone, armed with nothing but your blade and rage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/03b03b8f3f5664d4201b2b745a973bea.webp?t=1772460887\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/631cdda8b49219070b6f8959aaa5e731.poster.avif?t=1772460887\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/631cdda8b49219070b6f8959aaa5e731.webm?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/631cdda8b49219070b6f8959aaa5e731.mp4?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, deflect, and dismember with samurai precision. Chain lightning-fast moves, brutal takedowns, and charged slashes into seamless <strong>high-speed melee combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating finishers and heal by consuming the blood of your enemies \u2014 every strike feeding the Shrine\u2019s hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each procedurally generated level overflows with danger, secrets, and non-stop, blood-fueled action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/95550db868d26ea7f651a289d8b435d7.webp?t=1772460887\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/dbcb603b106c5124c40c3acfb40ac6a0.poster.avif?t=1772460887\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/dbcb603b106c5124c40c3acfb40ac6a0.webm?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/dbcb603b106c5124c40c3acfb40ac6a0.mp4?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip weapons from your enemies and turn their firepower against them \u2014 until the ammo runs dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then hurl the gun back in their face and unleash a charged katana strike to <strong>split them clean in half</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood sprays, limbs fly, and the survivors crawl away begging for mercy. None will be given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/1de3a9924aaccba93eb9f57ea0deada5.webp?t=1772460887\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.poster.avif?t=1772460887\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.webm?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/fcfb870fa9e5336658a878145dde75e8.mp4?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a stunning <strong>bloodpunk world</strong> where industrial-era machinery fuses with forbidden blood-powered technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Blood Orbs</strong> from chests, bosses, and hidden loot to unlock deadly katanas and specialized gear tied to the world mutation you\u2019re fighting through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Blood Orbs in battle to upgrade your equipped weapons and gear, evolving your abilities and carving out your own ruthless playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/b1c38eb896e49cb0b0fdd922537e4c02.webp?t=1772460887\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/e61f7e185d178f16b452892b4f6acb90.poster.avif?t=1772460887\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/e61f7e185d178f16b452892b4f6acb90.webm?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/e61f7e185d178f16b452892b4f6acb90.mp4?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a brutal roster of evolving bosses \u2014 each mutating into stronger, more vicious forms mid-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay them, take their heads, and offer their remains to the Shrine of Vermillion to restore balance through carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/d2c6564ee3badb6a4e0175af7bd105e2.webp?t=1772460887\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/07518ffdef676a9667a50b17ea888ecf.poster.avif?t=1772460887\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/07518ffdef676a9667a50b17ea888ecf.webm?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/07518ffdef676a9667a50b17ea888ecf.mp4?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>World Mutations</strong> that twist the rules of combat and reshape every run. Conquer them to earn new katanas, powers, and endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Blood</strong> is a relentless <strong>roguelike co-op action game</strong> \u2014 a challenge to master, a feast for the violent, and something to sink your teeth (and blade) into for hours on end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382290?t=1772460887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/ffc97fe7a7cdccc0d3f8854416fbaab3eff666f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772460887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/a2094f8ef3f49edcff65c5fb13d7d149fb9ccb2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772460887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/a2094f8ef3f49edcff65c5fb13d7d149fb9ccb2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772460887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gore, blood and bad language (censored voice over can be activated)."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3499930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/f1777c107e1d8a8d034d0d1f00ca6285.avif?t=1772460887\" width=640 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Blood</strong> is a brutal <strong>1\u20134 player co-op roguelike</strong> set in a twisted <strong>bloodpunk samurai world</strong>, where ruthless apes wield katanas in a revenge-fueled rampage against the mafia that desecrated their sacred Shrine of Vermillion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shrine now calls for retribution \u2014 and it\u2019s paid in blood, delivered through unrelenting <strong>katana combat</strong> and sheer brutality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/f2b1fe4625d4d92a01c452945fef4271.webp?t=1772460887\" width=592 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.poster.avif?t=1772460887\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382290/extras/353aa4def00ab860a172e13b214bff57.webm?t=1772460887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a